1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,972
7:02 a.m. Your phone buzzes.

2
00:00:03,342 --> 00:00:08,417
Plus $1. Sender: unknown. Memo... your name.

3
00:00:08,787 --> 00:00:11,180
MOM: Nev! Breakfast!

4
00:00:11,450 --> 00:00:12,846
Ding. Another dollar.

5
00:00:13,216 --> 00:00:14,059
MR. HALL: Nev?

6
00:00:14,329 --> 00:00:17,379
KIDS: Nev! Nev! Nev! Nev!

7
00:00:17,649 --> 00:00:21,666
So what if you earned $1... every time someone said your name?

8
00:00:22,936 --> 00:00:25,217
Okay. First, you test it.

9
00:00:25,587 --> 00:00:29,889
NEV: Nev. Nev... Nev!

10
00:00:30,159 --> 00:00:32,099
Nothing. Your own voice doesn't count.

11
00:00:32,469 --> 00:00:37,349
Texting it doesn't count either. It has to be said out loud. By someone else.

12
00:00:37,719 --> 00:00:41,687
So you call the one person who will do anything for free food.

13
00:00:42,057 --> 00:00:50,604
JAKE: Wait. You'll buy me tacos if I just say your name? Nev. Nev. Nev! Nev, Nev, Nev!

14
00:00:50,874 --> 00:00:51,836
Six dollars.

15
00:00:52,206 --> 00:00:58,049
JAKE: Bro, this is the easiest job I've ever had! Nev! Nev-Nev-Nev! Hahaha!

16
00:00:58,319 --> 00:01:06,832
By lunch, Jake has said your name 240 times. You buy him three tacos. You're still up 230 bucks.

17
00:01:07,802 --> 00:01:09,770
Then you learn the fine print.

18
00:01:10,140 --> 00:01:14,285
Whispers count. Even a whisper is a full dollar.

19
00:01:14,655 --> 00:01:18,358
JAKE: Nevvy? Nevster? Nev-a-licious? Hahaha!

20
00:01:18,628 --> 00:01:23,917
Nicknames don't count. Only the real thing. N, E, V.

21
00:01:24,287 --> 00:01:30,976
And recordings don't count. A video of someone saying your name, played a million times, pays you zero.

22
00:01:31,346 --> 00:01:34,663
But a million people... saying it themselves?

23
00:01:35,933 --> 00:01:39,795
Day three. You figure out the real trick.

24
00:01:40,165 --> 00:01:41,397
Names spread.

25
00:01:41,767 --> 00:01:49,031
You sign up for the school talent show. Your act? You just... stand there.

26
00:01:49,401 --> 00:01:51,441
And the whole gym chants.

27
00:01:51,811 --> 00:01:54,861
KIDS: Nev! Nev! Nev! Nev!

28
00:01:55,131 --> 00:02:00,840
400 kids. 90 seconds. Plus... $11,000.

29
00:02:01,210 --> 00:02:04,384
Somebody films it. By Friday, it's a trend.

30
00:02:04,754 --> 00:02:07,640
#SayNev. 14 million views.

31
00:02:08,010 --> 00:02:14,985
Kids in Ohio. A grandma in Texas. A guy on a fishing boat in Alaska.

32
00:02:15,355 --> 00:02:17,498
Everybody is saying your name.

33
00:02:17,868 --> 00:02:22,481
And your phone... never stops buzzing.

34
00:02:22,851 --> 00:02:25,636
Day nine. $1,284,000.

35
00:02:26,006 --> 00:02:28,352
You buy your mom a new car. You buy Jake a lifetime supply of tacos.

36
00:02:28,722 --> 00:02:32,183
JAKE: I'm not crying. You're crying! Hahaha.

37
00:02:33,053 --> 00:02:34,916
Then you start spending.

38
00:02:35,286 --> 00:02:39,353
You pay off the house. Mom cries in the kitchen for 20 minutes.

39
00:02:39,723 --> 00:02:44,557
You buy a gaming PC so big it needs its own fan... for its fan.

40
00:02:44,927 --> 00:02:50,420
You tip a waitress $1,000. She says, thank you, Nev. Plus one.

41
00:02:50,790 --> 00:03:01,332
JAKE: Bro, we should start a business. I'll be the manager. You'll be... the name.

42
00:03:01,602 --> 00:03:10,651
Jake prints T-shirts that just say NEV. He sells 9,000 of them. Everybody who reads one out loud... pays you.

43
00:03:12,221 --> 00:03:17,283
Then, Monday morning... Jake doesn't laugh.

44
00:03:17,653 --> 00:03:27,888
JAKE: Bro... my bank account. It's empty. Like, zero. I had 240 dollars yesterday.

45
00:03:28,158 --> 00:03:31,702
Two hundred and $40.

46
00:03:32,072 --> 00:03:35,835
The exact number of times he said your name.

47
00:03:36,205 --> 00:03:43,145
You check the transfers. Every single one has a sender. They're not coming from nowhere.

48
00:03:43,515 --> 00:03:49,692
Every time someone says your name... the dollar comes out of their pocket.

49
00:03:50,062 --> 00:03:56,112
MOM: Honey, my card got declined at the grocery store. That's weird, right?

50
00:03:56,382 --> 00:04:01,798
She said your name eleven times this week. Calling you for dinner.

51
00:04:02,168 --> 00:04:12,306
14 million people said Nev. 14 million people are $1 poorer. And they're starting to notice.

52
00:04:13,276 --> 00:04:16,605
A bus driver in Ohio can't fill up his tank.

53
00:04:16,975 --> 00:04:24,358
A grandma in Texas finds $40 missing from her pension. She said your name 40 times. She thought it was cute.

54
00:04:24,728 --> 00:04:31,094
People stop saying it. They point. They write it on paper. They call you, that kid.

55
00:04:31,464 --> 00:04:38,166
JAKE: Bro, my mom grounded me for saying your name at dinner. She thinks I'm in a gang.

56
00:04:38,436 --> 00:04:46,298
NEWS ANCHOR: Breaking news. Thousands of Americans report a mysterious $1 charge... every time they say one name.

57
00:04:47,268 --> 00:04:51,947
By Wednesday... nobody says your name anymore.

58
00:04:52,317 --> 00:04:55,405
MR. HALL: Student 14. Present?

59
00:04:55,675 --> 00:05:00,418
JAKE: Hey... dude. Hey, you. Uh... buddy.

60
00:05:00,688 --> 00:05:03,735
Your best friend won't say your name.

61
00:05:04,105 --> 00:05:08,425
Your mom calls you sweetheart now. Kiddo. Champ. Anything but Nev.

62
00:05:08,795 --> 00:05:10,527
The counter stops.

63
00:05:10,897 --> 00:05:20,101
And for the first time in your life... you realize how good it felt to just hear it.

64
00:05:21,271 --> 00:05:23,271
You try to make it stop.

65
00:05:23,641 --> 00:05:30,429
You change your name. Online forms, a judge, the whole thing. Your new name is Steve.

66
00:05:30,799 --> 00:05:37,731
Nothing changes. People still know you as Nev. And the money follows the name people say... not the name on the paper.

67
00:05:38,101 --> 00:05:44,079
JAKE: Steve? Bro, you don't look like a Steve. You look like... yeah, I'm not saying it.

68
00:05:45,449 --> 00:05:51,385
So you open the bank app. 14,200,000 transfers.

69
00:05:51,755 --> 00:05:55,300
There's a button you never noticed. Return all.

70
00:05:55,670 --> 00:05:57,692
Your thumb shakes.

71
00:05:58,062 --> 00:06:00,677
It's every dollar you have.

72
00:06:01,047 --> 00:06:03,083
You press it.

73
00:06:03,453 --> 00:06:09,335
Across America, 14 million phones buzz at once. Plus $1. Memo: sorry.

74
00:06:09,705 --> 00:06:11,385
MOM: Nev?

75
00:06:11,655 --> 00:06:16,519
It's the first time in a week anyone has said it.

76
00:06:16,889 --> 00:06:21,598
Your phone doesn't buzz. Plus nothing. Minus nothing.

77
00:06:21,968 --> 00:06:24,329
It's just your name again.

78
00:06:24,699 --> 00:06:27,112
MOM: Nev! Dinner! Love you, kiddo.

79
00:06:27,382 --> 00:06:34,424
JAKE: Nev! Nev! Nev! Bro, it's free now! I'm gonna say it all day! Hahaha!

80
00:06:35,894 --> 00:06:41,401
That night, at 3:33 a.m., your phone lights up one last time.

81
00:06:41,771 --> 00:06:46,341
Plus $1. Sender: unknown. Memo... Jake.

82
00:06:46,711 --> 00:06:48,234
JAKE: Wait. Why did I just get a dollar?

83
00:06:49,304 --> 00:06:52,824
Whose name would YOU want to get paid for? Tell us in the comments.
